# Coverage / test artefacts. The Playwright directories are anchored to the
# repository root, same reasoning as .gitignore's identical rule (commit
# 8120194): unanchored, they'd also match a same-named directory nested
# anywhere under apps/ or packages/, and Prettier 3 reads this file, so
# that would silently drop such a directory from `format`/`format:check`.
coverage
/test-results
/playwright-report
/blob-report

